    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The life of demons and their sidekicks is difficult.</h2><br>This time, the Order of fighters against evil kidnapped a demon, whom the warrior girl Tyria vowed to protect at all costs.<br><br>Go on a journey, explore a new fantasy world, meet colorful characters, swing your sword and achieve your goals!<br><br>There is no need to save the world; it is enough to return the great master Ma-Gorr back to his refuge, simultaneously dealing with the members of the Order.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950650/extras/devilguard-01.gif?t=1750657502\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Stamina based combat system</strong> with sword attacks, super attacks, dodges, blocks and parries<br></li><li><strong>Auxiliary combat magic</strong> that can be selected to suit your playstyle<br></li><li><strong>Improving character stats</strong> through new equipment and finding secret items<br></li><li><strong>Exploring the world</strong> according to the main story, side quests or finding secrets and better equipment<br></li><li><strong>Side quests</strong> with gameplay that differs from the main gameplay<br></li><li><strong>Mini-games</strong> that allow you to earn extra gold or just have fun</li></ul><br>Devilguard is a linear adventure with an emphasis on story, exploration and combat, centered around a compelling story of loyalty, friendship and duty. In addition to the main story, Devilguard includes side quests and fun mini-games that will help you relax despite the seriousness of the main mission.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950650/extras/f1949e8da9763df2dfc55ca689897a8a.avif?t=1750657502\" width=616 height=749 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The life of demons and their sidekicks is difficult.</h2><br>This time, the Order of fighters against evil kidnapped a demon, whom the warrior girl Tyria vowed to protect at all costs.<br><br>Go on a journey, explore a new fantasy world, meet colorful characters, swing your sword and achieve your goals!<br><br>There is no need to save the world; it is enough to return the great master Ma-Gorr back to his refuge, simultaneously dealing with the members of the Order.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950650/extras/devilguard-01.gif?t=1750657502\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Stamina based combat system</strong> with sword attacks, super attacks, dodges, blocks and parries<br></li><li><strong>Auxiliary combat magic</strong> that can be selected to suit your playstyle<br></li><li><strong>Improving character stats</strong> through new equipment and finding secret items<br></li><li><strong>Exploring the world</strong> according to the main story, side quests or finding secrets and better equipment<br></li><li><strong>Side quests</strong> with gameplay that differs from the main gameplay<br></li><li><strong>Mini-games</strong> that allow you to earn extra gold or just have fun</li></ul><br>Devilguard is a linear adventure with an emphasis on story, exploration and combat, centered around a compelling story of loyalty, friendship and duty. In addition to the main story, Devilguard includes side quests and fun mini-games that will help you relax despite the seriousness of the main mission.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950650/extras/f1949e8da9763df2dfc55ca689897a8a.avif?t=1750657502\" width=616 height=749 /></span>",
